# Raw registry dumps. Large, and permanently re-downloadable from a pinned
# Zenodo version, so the Makefile can always rebuild.
data/
__pycache__/

# orgs.jsonl is 22 MB and regenerates in ~40s from a pinned dump. This repo
# does commit data generously (extra/core's 10,284 files, resolved.ndjson at
# 7 MB) but those are one-time pulls; this one is rebuilt every ROR release,
# so committing it would add ~22 MB to history a dozen times a year for a file
# `make orgs.jsonl` reproduces exactly. edges.jsonl IS committed: it is 2 MB,
# derives only from sources already in this repo, needs no network, and is the
# validation set Phase 2 is checked against.
orgs.jsonl
